<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<!-- Base URL so Puppeteer (which renders this page via page.setContent(), not
     a real page navigation) can resolve the relative logo image path below.
     Without this, /assets/... would not load in the PDF render. -->
<base href="https://medhaiq.ai/">
<title>MedhaIQ Career Intelligence Report</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Plus+Jakarta+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700;800&family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">

<!--
  STEP 2B — WHITE EXECUTIVE VISUAL REDESIGN (docs/MEDHAIQ_REPORTING_DESIGN_V1.md §7).
  Presentation only. Same 3-page structure, same section order, same data
  variables as Step 2A (server.js's PDF route was not touched in this step).

  WHAT CHANGED (visual):
   - Page 1's dark gradient cover → plain white page, matching pages 2–3.
   - 5-Vector radar/spider SVG → horizontal bar cards (white-executive spec
     explicitly asked for bars/segmented cards over a radar chart).
   - All "on-dark" text/badge/card treatments replaced with light
     surfaces + a single restrained accent color (no rainbow, no gradients
     beyond the original two-stop brand mark, which is now a flat accent
     color instead).
   - Vector labels updated to the LOCKED terminology (Structure / Domain
     Expertise / Strategic Thinking / Communication / Leadership &
     Execution) — Step 2A deliberately kept the legacy raw-field labels
     (Structure/Technical/Executive/GCC/Comm.) because that step was
     data-consolidation-only and explicitly preserved existing wording;
     this is the step the design doc designates for terminology to catch
     up to the locked model. The underlying VALUES are unchanged — same
     starAvg/technicalAvg/executiveAvg/gccAvg/frictionAvg passed in by
     server.js, same locked mapping (design doc §2), just displayed under
     their final names.
   - qa-table column order reordered to match the locked vector order
     (Structure, Domain Expertise, Strategic Thinking, Communication,
     Leadership & Execution) now that it's no longer constrained by radar
     geometry. Same qa.vectors.* values as Step 2A, different column
     arrangement only.
   - vectorLabel(key) (used for topStrengths/topDevelopmentAreas/
     practiceFocus, which key off the LEGACY scoreboard.vector_breakdown
     'vector' field: structure/technical/executive/gcc/communication) now
     maps to the locked labels too, for whenever that array is populated —
     see the Step 2A note further down; vector_breakdown is still always
     empty today (REPORT_SYSTEM never generates it), so these three
     sections still render empty. Not fixed in this step — flagged again,
     not touched, per the Step 2A decision.

  WHAT DID NOT CHANGE:
   - Page structure/order, section headings and body copy (executive
     summary text, recommendation label, STAR framework copy, callout
     copy, roadmap copy) are byte-identical to Step 2A.
   - No server.js changes — same data contract, same variable names
     (starAvg, technicalAvg, executiveAvg, gccAvg, frictionAvg, qaCards,
     starCounts, starTotal, topStrengths, topDevelopmentAreas,
     practiceFocus, candidateModel, evidenceMaturity, nextSteps, report).
   - radarPolygonPoints/radarPoints are still computed and passed by
     server.js (buildRadarPolygon() call, unchanged) but are no longer
     consumed by this template now that the radar is gone — harmless
     unused data, left for a future cleanup pass rather than touched here
     (touching server.js was out of scope for a template-only step).
   - No scoring, STAR, interview-engine, DB, or renderer-internals changes.
-->

<style>
  @page { size: 8.5in 11in; margin: 0; }
  * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
  html, body { width: 8.5in; background: #E7E9EE; }
  body { font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, sans-serif; color: #1B2130; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; }
  *, *::before, *::after { animation: none !important; transition: none !important; }

  .page { width: 8.5in; height: 11in; background: #FFFFFF; position: relative; overflow: hidden; page-break-after: always; break-after: page; }
  .page:last-of-type { page-break-after: auto; break-after: auto; }
  .avoid-break { page-break-inside: avoid; break-inside: avoid; }
  @media print { html, body { background: #FFFFFF; } .page { box-shadow: none !important; } }
  @media screen { body { padding: 24px 0; } .page { margin: 0 auto 24px; box-shadow: 0 4px 24px rgba(15,23,42,0.08); } }

  /* Single restrained accent (--signal) + two muted semantic tones for
     strength/development states — no rainbow, no gradients. */
  :root {
    --ink: #1B2130; --paper: #FFFFFF; --surface: #F7F8FA;
    --signal: #2554C7; --signal-dark: #1E40AF; --signal-soft: #EEF3FC;
    --emerald: #0F7B4E; --emerald-soft: #EAF7F1; --emerald-line: #CDEBDD;
    --amber: #9A5B14; --amber-soft: #FBF1E4; --amber-line: #F0DBB8;
    --line: #E3E6EC; --gray-500: #64748B; --gray-700: #3A4150;
  }
  .font-display { font-family: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', 'Inter', sans-serif; }
  .eyebrow { font-family:'Inter'; font-size:9.5px; font-weight:700; letter-spacing:.16em; text-transform:uppercase; color:var(--signal); }
  h2.page-title { font-size:19px; font-weight:800; color:var(--ink); }
  h3.card-title { font-size:12.5px; font-weight:700; color:var(--ink); }
  .text-body { font-size:11.5px; line-height:1.55; color:var(--gray-700); }
  .text-caption { font-size:9.5px; color:var(--gray-500); }

  .flex { display:flex; } .flex-col { display:flex; flex-direction:column; }
  .items-center { align-items:center; } .items-start { align-items:flex-start; }
  .justify-between { justify-content:space-between; }
  .gap-8{gap:8px;} .gap-12{gap:12px;} .gap-16{gap:16px;} .gap-24{gap:24px;}
  .grid-2 { display:grid; grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr; }
  .grid-3 { display:grid; grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr 1fr; }
  .rounded-lg{border-radius:10px;} .rounded-xl{border-radius:14px;}
  .p-16{padding:16px;} .p-20{padding:20px;} .px-48{padding-left:48px;padding-right:48px;}

  .cover-topbar { display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:space-between; padding:26px 48px 0; }
  .brand-mark { display:flex; align-items:center; gap:8px; }
  .brand-mark img { height:20px; display:block; }
  .brand-name { font-family:'Plus Jakarta Sans'; font-weight:700; letter-spacing:-0.04em; font-size:16px; color:var(--ink); }
  .brand-name .iq { color: var(--signal); }
  .badge { display:inline-flex; align-items:center; gap:5px; padding:5px 11px; border-radius:999px; font-size:9.5px; font-weight:700; background:var(--surface); border:1px solid var(--line); color:var(--gray-700); }
  .badge-dot { width:6px; height:6px; border-radius:999px; flex-shrink:0; }
  .exec-summary-box { background:var(--surface); border:1px solid var(--line); border-left:3px solid var(--signal); }
  .rec-pill { display:inline-block; padding:6px 14px; border-radius:999px; font-weight:800; font-size:11px; font-family:'Plus Jakarta Sans'; }

  .page-header { display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:space-between; padding:22px 48px 14px; border-bottom:1px solid var(--line); }
  .page-footer { position:absolute; bottom:0; left:0; right:0; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:space-between; padding:12px 48px; border-top:1px solid var(--line); font-size:8.5px; color:var(--gray-500); }

  /* 5-Vector — horizontal bar cards (replaces the radar/spider chart). */
  .vector-card { border:1px solid var(--line); border-radius:12px; padding:16px 18px; background:#fff; }
  .vector-row { display:flex; align-items:center; gap:12px; padding:8px 0; border-bottom:1px solid var(--line); }
  .vector-row:last-child { border-bottom:none; }
  .vector-label { width:150px; flex-shrink:0; font-size:11px; font-weight:600; color:var(--ink); }
  .vector-track { flex:1; height:8px; background:var(--surface); border-radius:4px; overflow:hidden; }
  .vector-fill { height:100%; background:var(--signal); border-radius:4px; }
  .vector-score { width:26px; flex-shrink:0; text-align:right; font-family:'Plus Jakarta Sans'; font-weight:800; font-size:13px; color:var(--ink); }

  .sw-card { border:1px solid var(--line); border-radius:12px; padding:14px; }
  .sw-card + .sw-card { margin-top:10px; }
  .sw-vector { font-size:9px; font-weight:700; text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:.03em; margin-bottom:3px; }
  .sw-text { font-size:11px; line-height:1.5; color:var(--gray-700); }
  .sw-card.strength { background:var(--emerald-soft); border-color:var(--emerald-line); }
  .sw-card.strength .sw-vector { color:var(--emerald); }
  .sw-card.development { background:var(--amber-soft); border-color:var(--amber-line); }
  .sw-card.development .sw-vector { color:var(--amber); }

  .star-ring { width:64px; height:64px; border-radius:999px; border:5px solid var(--line); display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; position:relative; }
  .star-ring.is-filled { border-color: var(--signal); }
  .star-ring-label { font-size:20px; font-weight:800; font-family:'Plus Jakarta Sans'; color:var(--ink); }
  .star-letter { font-size:10px; font-weight:800; text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:.04em; color:var(--gray-500); margin-top:6px; text-align:center; }

  .qa-table { width:100%; border-collapse:collapse; }
  .qa-table th { text-align:left; font-size:8.5px; text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:.03em; color:var(--gray-500); padding:6px 8px; border-bottom:1px solid var(--line); }
  .qa-table td { font-size:10.5px; padding:7px 8px; border-bottom:1px solid var(--line); color:var(--gray-700); vertical-align:top; }
  .qa-table td.num { text-align:center; font-weight:700; color:var(--signal-dark); font-family:'Plus Jakarta Sans'; }

  .callout { border-radius:10px; padding:14px; }
  .callout.strong { background:var(--emerald-soft); border-left:3px solid var(--emerald); }
  .callout.weak { background:var(--amber-soft); border-left:3px solid var(--amber); }

  .cm-card { border:1px solid var(--line); border-radius:10px; padding:10px; text-align:center; }
  .cm-num { font-family:'Plus Jakarta Sans'; font-weight:800; font-size:19px; color:var(--signal-dark); }
  .cm-label { font-size:8.5px; color:var(--gray-500); margin-top:3px; text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:.03em; }

  .timeline-rail { position:relative; padding-left:28px; }
  .timeline-rail::before { content:''; position:absolute; left:7px; top:4px; bottom:4px; width:2px; background:var(--line); }
  .timeline-item { position:relative; padding-bottom:16px; }
  .timeline-item:last-child { padding-bottom:0; }
  .timeline-dot { position:absolute; left:-28px; top:1px; width:16px; height:16px; border-radius:999px; background:#fff; border:3px solid var(--signal); }
  .practice-focus-box { background:var(--signal-soft); border:1px solid var(--line); border-radius:10px; padding:14px; }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<%
  function recColor(rec) {
    if (/strong hire|^hire$/i.test(rec || '')) return { bg: '#DCFCE7', fg: '#15803D' };
    if (/lean hire/i.test(rec || '')) return { bg: '#FEF9C3', fg: '#A16207' };
    return { bg: '#FEE2E2', fg: '#B91C1C' };
  }
  var recStyle = recColor(report.recommendation);

  // Locked product-facing vector labels (docs/MEDHAIQ_REPORTING_DESIGN_V1.md
  // §2) — same underlying values as Step 2A, same locked mapping, just
  // displayed under their final names and in the locked display order.
  var pageVectors = [
    { label: 'Structure', score: starAvg },
    { label: 'Domain Expertise', score: technicalAvg },
    { label: 'Strategic Thinking', score: executiveAvg },
    { label: 'Communication', score: frictionAvg },
    { label: 'Leadership & Execution', score: gccAvg },
  ];

  // Maps the LEGACY scoreboard.vector_breakdown 'vector' key (still
  // structure/technical/executive/gcc/communication — that AI JSON schema
  // is untouched, out of scope) to the locked display labels, for
  // topStrengths/topDevelopmentAreas/practiceFocus below. vector_breakdown
  // is confirmed always empty today (see comment above and the Step 2A
  // note in server.js), so these three sections still render empty — this
  // mapping is here so the labels are correct the moment that changes,
  // not because it changes anything visible right now.
  var legacyKeyToLabel = {
    structure: 'Structure',
    technical: 'Domain Expertise',
    executive: 'Strategic Thinking',
    communication: 'Communication',
    gcc: 'Leadership & Execution',
  };
  function vectorLabel(key) { return legacyKeyToLabel[key] || key; }
%>

<!-- ══════════════════ PAGE 1 — EXECUTIVE CAREER INTELLIGENCE SUMMARY ══════════════════ -->
<section class="page">
  <div class="cover-topbar">
    <div class="brand-mark">
      <img src="/assets/branding/medhaiq-icon.png" alt="MedhaIQ">
      <span class="brand-name">Medha<span class="iq">IQ</span></span>
    </div>
    <div class="eyebrow">EXECUTIVE CAREER INTELLIGENCE REPORT</div>
  </div>

  <div style="padding:16px 48px 0;">
    <div class="text-caption"><%= candidateName %> · <%= roleTitle %> · <%= formattedDate %></div>
  </div>

  <div class="flex items-center gap-24" style="padding:16px 48px 0;">
    <div style="position:relative; width:150px; height:150px; flex-shrink:0;">
      <svg width="150" height="150" viewBox="0 0 150 150">
        <circle cx="75" cy="75" r="63" fill="none" stroke="var(--line)" stroke-width="11"/>
        <% var circumference = 2 * Math.PI * 63; var dash = circumference * (Math.max(0, Math.min(100, report.overall_score)) / 100); %>
        <circle cx="75" cy="75" r="63" fill="none" stroke="#2554C7" stroke-width="11" stroke-linecap="round"
                stroke-dasharray="<%= dash.toFixed(1) %> <%= circumference.toFixed(1) %>" transform="rotate(-90 75 75)"/>
      </svg>
      <div class="flex-col items-center" style="position:absolute; top:0; left:0; width:150px; height:150px; justify-content:center;">
        <div style="font-family:'Plus Jakarta Sans'; font-weight:800; font-size:42px; color:var(--ink); line-height:1;"><%= Math.round(report.overall_score) %></div>
        <div style="font-size:11px; color:var(--gray-500); font-weight:600;">out of 100</div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="flex-col gap-8" style="flex:1;">
      <div class="eyebrow">OVERALL CAREER INTELLIGENCE SCORE</div>
      <div><span class="rec-pill" style="background:<%= recStyle.bg %>; color:<%= recStyle.fg %>;">HIRING RECOMMENDATION: <%= report.recommendation %></span></div>
      <div class="flex gap-8" style="flex-wrap:wrap; margin-top:2px;">
        <span class="badge"><span class="badge-dot" style="background:var(--signal);"></span>Leadership Potential: <%= leadershipPotential %></span>
        <span class="badge"><span class="badge-dot" style="background:var(--amber);"></span>Confidence Level: <%= confidenceLevel %></span>
      </div>
      <div class="text-caption" style="margin-top:2px;">Interviewed by <%= personaName %></div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div style="padding:16px 48px 0;">
    <div class="exec-summary-box rounded-lg p-16">
      <div class="eyebrow" style="margin-bottom:6px;">EXECUTIVE SUMMARY</div>
      <p style="font-size:11.5px; line-height:1.6; color:var(--gray-700);"><%= report.executive_summary %></p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="flex gap-16" style="padding:16px 48px 0;">
    <div style="flex:1;">
      <div class="eyebrow" style="margin-bottom:8px;">5-VECTOR INTELLIGENCE</div>
      <div class="vector-card">
        <% pageVectors.forEach(function(v) { %>
          <div class="vector-row">
            <div class="vector-label"><%= v.label %></div>
            <div class="vector-track"><div class="vector-fill" style="width:<%= Math.max(0, Math.min(100, Math.round(v.score))) %>%;"></div></div>
            <div class="vector-score"><%= Math.round(v.score) %></div>
          </div>
        <% }); %>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div style="flex:1;">
      <div class="eyebrow" style="margin-bottom:8px;">TOP 3 STRENGTHS</div>
      <% topStrengths.forEach(function(s) { %>
        <div class="sw-card strength avoid-break">
          <div class="sw-vector"><%= vectorLabel(s.vector) %></div>
          <div class="sw-text"><%= s.strength %></div>
        </div>
      <% }); %>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div style="padding:14px 48px 0;">
    <div class="eyebrow" style="margin-bottom:8px;">DEVELOPMENT AREAS</div>
    <% if (topDevelopmentAreas.length > 0) { %>
      <div class="<%= topDevelopmentAreas.length >= 3 ? 'grid-3' : 'grid-2' %> gap-8" style="max-width:<%= topDevelopmentAreas.length >= 3 ? '100%' : '66%' %>;">
        <% topDevelopmentAreas.forEach(function(d) { %>
          <div class="sw-card development avoid-break" style="margin-top:0;">
            <div class="sw-vector"><%= vectorLabel(d.vector) %></div>
            <div class="sw-text"><%= d.recommendation %></div>
          </div>
        <% }); %>
      </div>
    <% } else if (!hasReliableSignal) { %>
      <p class="text-body" style="max-width:66%;">Insufficient evidence for capability assessment. The interview contained no substantive responses, so specific development priorities could not be reliably determined.</p>
    <% } else { %>
      <div class="grid-3 gap-8">
        <% canonicalDevelopmentAreas.forEach(function(d) { %>
          <div class="sw-card development avoid-break" style="margin-top:0;">
            <div class="sw-vector"><%= d.label %></div>
            <div class="sw-text"><%= d.score %>/100</div>
          </div>
        <% }); %>
      </div>
    <% } %>
  </div>

  <div class="page-footer">
    <span>MedhaIQ.ai · Confidential Career Intelligence Report</span>
    <span>Page 1 of 3</span>
  </div>
</section>


<!-- ══════════════════ PAGE 2 — INTERVIEW INTELLIGENCE ══════════════════ -->
<section class="page">
  <div class="page-header">
    <div><div class="eyebrow">SECTION 02</div><h2 class="page-title font-display">Interview Intelligence</h2></div>
    <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 100 100" style="opacity:.35;"><polygon points="50,4 95,36 78,90 22,90 5,36" fill="none" stroke="#2554C7" stroke-width="4"/></svg>
  </div>

  <div class="px-48" style="padding-top:18px;">
    <!-- STAR Assessment — same 4-component framework (Situation/Task/Action/
         Result) and same detection function used during the live interview.
         Each ring shows % of answered questions where that component was
         present; overall STAR score is the same Structure vector average
         shown on page 1, not a separately invented number. -->
    <h3 class="card-title" style="margin-bottom:2px;">STAR Assessment</h3>
    <div class="text-caption" style="margin-bottom:12px;">Same Situation / Task / Action / Result framework used during Interview Setup and the Live Interview.</div>
    <div class="flex items-center" style="justify-content:space-between;">
      <% ['situation','task','action','result'].forEach(function(letter) {
           var count = starCounts[letter]; var pct = starTotal ? Math.round((count / starTotal) * 100) : 0;
           var filled = pct >= 60; %>
        <div class="flex-col items-center">
          <div class="star-ring<%= filled ? ' is-filled' : '' %>"><div class="star-ring-label"><%= pct %>%</div></div>
          <div class="star-letter"><%= letter %></div>
          <div class="text-caption"><%= count %>/<%= starTotal %> answers</div>
        </div>
      <% }); %>
      <div class="flex-col items-center" style="border-left:1px solid var(--line); padding-left:24px;">
        <div style="font-family:'Plus Jakarta Sans'; font-weight:800; font-size:30px; color:var(--signal-dark);"><%= Math.round(starAvg) %></div>
        <div class="star-letter">Overall STAR Score</div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Condensed question table — one page, no per-question cards. Column
         order matches the locked vector order (Structure, Domain
         Expertise, Strategic Thinking, Communication, Leadership &
         Execution) — Step 2A used the old radar-geometry order since the
         radar was still on page 1 then; now that it's gone, this table
         and the page-1 bars use the same order. -->
    <h3 class="card-title" style="margin-top:20px; margin-bottom:8px;">Key Interview Questions &amp; Scores</h3>
    <table class="qa-table avoid-break">
      <tr><th>#</th><th>Question</th><th>Structure</th><th>Domain Exp.</th><th>Strategic Think.</th><th>Comm.</th><th>Leadership</th></tr>
      <% qaCards.forEach(function(qa) { %>
        <tr>
          <td><%= qa.index %></td>
          <td><%= qa.questionText.length > 70 ? qa.questionText.slice(0, 70) + '…' : qa.questionText %></td>
          <% if (qa.vectors) { %>
            <td class="num"><%= qa.vectors.structure %></td>
            <td class="num"><%= qa.vectors.domainExpertise %></td>
            <td class="num"><%= qa.vectors.strategicThinking %></td>
            <td class="num"><%= qa.vectors.communication %></td>
            <td class="num"><%= qa.vectors.leadershipExecution %></td>
          <% } else { %>
            <td class="num" colspan="5" style="color:var(--gray-500); font-weight:400;">Skipped</td>
          <% } %>
        </tr>
      <% }); %>
    </table>

    <!-- Real AI feedback that already exists — NOT fabricated per-question
         text. strongest_response/weakest_response are genuine outputs from
         the same report-generation AI call, each with an actual quote from
         the transcript. -->
    <div class="grid-2 gap-16" style="margin-top:18px;">
      <% if (report.strongest_response) { %>
        <div class="callout strong avoid-break">
          <h3 class="card-title" style="margin-bottom:4px;">Highlighted Response</h3>
          <div class="text-caption" style="margin-bottom:6px;"><%= report.strongest_response.context %></div>
          <div class="text-body">"<%= report.strongest_response.evidence %>"</div>
        </div>
      <% } %>
      <% if (report.weakest_response) { %>
        <div class="callout weak avoid-break">
          <h3 class="card-title" style="margin-bottom:4px;">Growth Opportunity</h3>
          <div class="text-caption" style="margin-bottom:6px;"><%= report.weakest_response.context %></div>
          <div class="text-body">"<%= report.weakest_response.evidence %>"</div>
        </div>
      <% } %>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="page-footer"><span>MedhaIQ.ai · Confidential Career Intelligence Report</span><span>Page 2 of 3</span></div>
</section>


<!-- ══════════════════ PAGE 3 — CAREER ROADMAP ══════════════════ -->
<section class="page">
  <div class="page-header">
    <div><div class="eyebrow">SECTION 03</div><h2 class="page-title font-display">Career Roadmap</h2></div>
    <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 100 100" style="opacity:.35;"><polygon points="50,4 95,36 78,90 22,90 5,36" fill="none" stroke="#2554C7" stroke-width="4"/></svg>
  </div>

  <div class="px-48" style="padding-top:16px;">
    <!-- Simplified Candidate Model — only the 5 most meaningful dimensions
         are shown here. Ownership, Learning Agility, and Technical Depth
         are still computed and still power the interview engine's
         Difficulty Controller / question routing — they're just not
         displayed in this report by design. -->
    <% if (candidateModel) { %>
      <h3 class="card-title" style="margin-bottom:8px;">Candidate Model</h3>
      <div class="grid-3 gap-8" style="margin-bottom:6px;">
        <div class="cm-card"><div class="cm-num"><%= candidateModel.confidence %></div><div class="cm-label">Confidence</div></div>
        <div class="cm-card"><div class="cm-num"><%= candidateModel.communication %></div><div class="cm-label">Communication</div></div>
        <div class="cm-card"><div class="cm-num"><%= candidateModel.leadership %></div><div class="cm-label">Leadership</div></div>
      </div>
      <div class="grid-2 gap-8">
        <div class="cm-card"><div class="cm-num"><%= candidateModel.decisionMaking %></div><div class="cm-label">Decision-Making</div></div>
        <div class="cm-card"><div class="cm-num"><%= candidateModel.businessThinking %></div><div class="cm-label">Business Thinking</div></div>
      </div>
    <% } %>

    <div class="grid-2 gap-16" style="margin-top:18px;">
      <div>
        <h3 class="card-title" style="margin-bottom:8px;">Key Strengths</h3>
        <% topStrengths.forEach(function(s) { %>
          <div class="text-body" style="margin-bottom:4px;">✓ <%= vectorLabel(s.vector) %></div>
        <% }); %>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h3 class="card-title" style="margin-bottom:8px;">Development Priorities</h3>
        <% if (topDevelopmentAreas.length > 0) { %>
          <% topDevelopmentAreas.forEach(function(d) { %>
            <div class="text-body" style="margin-bottom:4px;">→ <%= vectorLabel(d.vector) %></div>
          <% }); %>
        <% } else if (!hasReliableSignal) { %>
          <p class="text-body">Insufficient evidence for capability assessment. The interview contained no substantive responses, so specific development priorities could not be reliably determined.</p>
        <% } else { %>
          <% canonicalDevelopmentAreas.forEach(function(d) { %>
            <div class="text-body" style="margin-bottom:4px;">→ <%= d.label %> (<%= d.score %>/100)</div>
          <% }); %>
        <% } %>
      </div>
    </div>

    <% if (practiceFocus) { %>
      <div class="practice-focus-box avoid-break" style="margin-top:16px;">
        <div class="eyebrow" style="margin-bottom:4px;">NEXT RECOMMENDED PRACTICE FOCUS</div>
        <h3 class="card-title" style="margin-bottom:4px;"><%= vectorLabel(practiceFocus.vector) %></h3>
        <div class="text-body"><%= practiceFocus.recommendation %></div>
      </div>
    <% } %>

    <h3 class="card-title" style="margin-top:20px; margin-bottom:10px;">Growth Roadmap</h3>
    <div class="timeline-rail">
      <% var windows = ['0–30 Days', '30–60 Days', '60–90 Days']; %>
      <% windows.forEach(function(label, i) { %>
        <% if (nextSteps[i]) { %>
          <div class="timeline-item avoid-break">
            <div class="timeline-dot"></div>
            <div class="eyebrow" style="margin-bottom:2px;"><%= label.toUpperCase() %></div>
            <p class="text-body"><%= nextSteps[i] %></p>
          </div>
        <% } %>
      <% }); %>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="page-footer"><span>MedhaIQ.ai · Confidential Career Intelligence Report</span><span>Page 3 of 3</span></div>
</section>

</body>
</html>
